            "review_text": "Oliver Sinclair\n9 contributions\n0\nEvery time I come back to Vietnam, I try to revisit restaurants that have given me a memorable experience.\nJul 2026 • Solo\nHem Quan Vu Pham Ham has become one of those places. I like that the restaurant offers a calm environment with spacious seating, making it suitable for both business dinners and casual meals with friends. The experience has always been consistent, which is something I really value when returning to a familiar restaurant.\nWritten July 23, 2026",
