            "review_text": "Catherine Hayes\n8 contributions\n0\nI was attending a conference nearby and several participants decided to have dinner at Hem Quan after the event.\nJul 2026 • Friends\nThe location was very convenient, and arriving by taxi was easy since the restaurant is directly on Vu Pham Ham Street. We reserved one of the private rooms, which allowed everyone to continue networking in a comfortable setting. The combination of good food and a quiet space made the evening much more enjoyable than eating in a noisy restaurant.\nRead more\nWritten July 19, 2026",
