            "review_title": "Review at Hẻm Quán 92 Vũ Phạm Hàm",
            "review_text": "Naomi J\n6 contributions\n0\nMy Vietnamese friends invited me here because they wanted me to experience Southern Vietnamese food.\nJul 2026 • Friends\nWhat impressed me most was the way everyone shared the dishes together. It wasn't just about eating; it felt like a social experience. The restaurant had a welcoming atmosphere, and the staff gave us enough time to enjoy the evening without constantly interrupting. I left with a much better appreciation of Vietnamese dining culture.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 18, 2026",
