            "review_text": "Anna L\n7 contributions\n0\nDuring my stay in Hanoi, I was looking for a restaurant where I could have a relaxed dinner with a few friends instead o\nJul 2026 • Friends\nHem Quan Vu Pham Ham turned out to be a great choice. The restaurant has different seating options, and we chose an indoor table because it was quiet and comfortable. We stayed for quite a while, enjoying the meal and conversation without ever feeling rushed. It was one of those places that felt genuinely local rather than designed for tourists.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 13, 2026",
